00:46:57,020 --> 00:47:00,020
we're only absorbing a total of 2% of all health spending.

182
00:47:00,020 --> 00:47:02,740
So this problem is greatly exaggerated.

183
00:47:02,740 --> 00:47:04,700
I agree that when people talk about health care,

