00:47:58,540 --> 00:48:01,700
and clearly I have not adequately understood

209
00:48:01,700 --> 00:48:03,980
normal mankind well enough in order to explain it,

210
00:48:03,980 --> 00:48:05,420
but it's weird to me.

211
00:48:09,860 --> 00:48:12,020
So as I said, so other examples.

