00:50:43,580 --> 00:50:46,700
And then they were hoping to get a giant dash of free publicity

275
00:50:46,700 --> 00:50:49,220
economists, prevent terrorist attack.

276
00:50:49,220 --> 00:50:50,260
But it didn't work.

277
00:50:50,260 --> 00:50:51,540
All right.

278
00:50:51,540 --> 00:50:54,900
But anyway, so I'm not sure, I don't

