00:51:02,540 --> 00:51:03,580
well, that's really cool.

283
00:51:03,580 --> 00:51:05,340
But all right.

284
00:51:05,340 --> 00:51:07,220
I don't hear that idea.

285
00:51:07,220 --> 00:51:07,940
All right.

286
00:51:07,940 --> 00:51:09,780
So questions.

287
00:51:09,780 --> 00:51:13,140
So adverse selection, one of the most abused ideas

288
00:51:13,140 --> 00:51:16,140
