289
00:51:16,140 --> 00:51:18,260
that people want for totally different reasons that

290
00:51:18,260 --> 00:51:21,220
are actually inconsistent with the model.

291
00:51:21,220 --> 00:51:21,740
All right.

292
00:51:21,740 --> 00:51:23,140
And kind of embarrassing, really,

293
00:51:23,140 --> 00:51:26,700
how many economists have let to go and rationalize the status

294
00:51:26,700 --> 00:51:31,140
quo for solving a problem that seems to, in fact, be largely

