156
01:05:56,760 --> 01:05:58,240
almost no one who takes one class

157
01:05:58,240 --> 01:05:59,560
in Aristotle really understand it,

158
01:05:59,560 --> 01:06:00,920
so it still doesn't make any sense

159
01:06:00,920 --> 01:06:02,600
that people would pay for it.

160
01:06:02,600 --> 01:06:05,760
And yet, employers seem to make a big deal out of it.

161
01:06:05,760 --> 01:06:07,280
And when you start going down the list

162
01:06:07,280 --> 01:06:10,040
of the different things that you've had to study in life,

163
01:06:10,040 --> 01:06:11,960
the list gets very long, right.

164
01:06:11,960 --> 01:06:14,240
So, in the United States, how many years

165
01:06:14,240 --> 01:06:16,000
of high school foreign language did you have

166
01:06:16,000 --> 01:06:18,000
to do just to get into college?

167
01:06:18,000 --> 01:06:20,720
Yeah, two years.

168
01:06:20,720 --> 01:06:24,960
California, it's actually three if you go to either UC or CSU.

169
01:06:24,960 --> 01:06:26,840
So, like more elite colleges,

170
01:06:26,840 --> 01:06:29,400
you may actually need four years of foreign language.

171
01:06:29,400 --> 01:06:32,400
All right, now, four years of foreign language,

172
01:06:32,400 --> 01:06:36,880
