01:09:27,440 --> 01:09:30,160
Right. So, and yet, how many years

243
01:09:30,160 --> 01:09:32,880
of social studies did you have to do?

244
01:09:32,880 --> 01:09:34,800
Or, yeah, like, it was on and on and on.

245
01:09:34,800 --> 01:09:38,920
And yet, even, like, showing two lines crossing was beyond them

246
01:09:38,920 --> 01:09:42,160
to actually tell the students about this stuff.

