01:10:03,400 --> 01:10:04,720
I'm not talking about just college.

259
01:10:04,720 --> 01:10:06,400
I'm talking about from day one of kindergarten.

260
01:10:06,400 --> 01:10:08,720
This is the way the world seemed to me.

261
01:10:08,720 --> 01:10:11,560
Day one of kindergarten, there's a bunch of things we had to do

262
01:10:11,560 --> 01:10:14,200
where if you didn't do them, there was a big problem.

263
01:10:14,200 --> 01:10:16,720
And, you might even be held back a grade.

264
01:10:16,720 --> 01:10:18,600
And yet, when you need, so, like, what's that?

265
01:10:18,600 --> 01:10:20,800
Like, singing and dancing?

266
01:10:20,800 --> 01:10:26,160
Yeah. So, when my kids were in grades four through six,

267
01:10:26,160 --> 01:10:30,560
