01:10:40,760 --> 01:10:43,160
Could they just go to the library?

273
01:10:43,160 --> 01:10:45,360
And, no, there's no way to get out of it.

274
01:10:45,360 --> 01:10:49,240
You must do this stuff because there's so much

275
01:10:49,240 --> 01:10:51,760
of the modern economy is based on music and dancing.

276
01:10:51,760 --> 01:10:53,560
Now, you know, a lot of people want to say, oh, but it's,

277
01:10:53,560 --> 01:10:54,920
you know, like, people learn

278
01:10:54,920 --> 01:10:57,160
and people enjoy these subjects.

279
01:10:57,160 --> 01:10:59,240
First of all, there's a lot of people who don't enjoy them

