29
01:21:09,880 --> 01:21:14,280
Instead, you're just looking for a good bet, a good gamble.

30
01:21:14,280 --> 01:21:17,600
Is this person going to be the best use of my money

31
01:21:17,600 --> 01:21:18,920
that I've got, that I can think of,

32
01:21:18,920 --> 01:21:20,760
that I've been able to find?

33
01:21:20,760 --> 01:21:22,760
All right, so if you're behind demand,

