01:21:22,760 --> 01:21:24,680
then it's gonna be in the interest of your school,

35
01:21:24,680 --> 01:21:26,160
fill out an application for extra care,

36
01:21:26,160 --> 01:21:28,680
provide a warranty, and even if the effort

