01:21:47,880 --> 01:21:49,680
All right, so another way to think about it

45
01:21:49,680 --> 01:21:51,220
is people want what the effort proves

46
01:21:51,220 --> 01:21:53,200
you already had in the first place.

47
01:21:53,200 --> 01:21:56,400
The point of taking a bunch of pointless classes in school

48
01:21:56,400 --> 01:21:59,520
isn't that you're learning how to do a pointless job.

49
